@startuml ai_architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam linetype ortho

' Tăng mạnh khoảng cách ngang và dọc để không bị đè chữ
skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam ranksep 120

rectangle "Spring Boot Backend" as Backend #DBEAFE

database "PostgreSQL\n(pgvector)" as DB #FEF3C7

package "Python AI Service (FastAPI)" as AIService #F8FAFC {
  component "api_service.py\n(Synchronous REST Gateway)" as API #E0F2FE
  component "worker.py\n(Asynchronous Background Task)" as Worker #EEF2FF

  rectangle "AI Core Engines" as Core #FFFFFF {
    component "recommender.py\n(ALS & Hybrid)" as Recommender #FDF2F8
    component "embedding_client.py\n(SentenceTransformer)" as Embedding #ECFDF5
    component "llm_client.py\n(Prompt & JSON Parsing)" as LLMClient #FFF7ED
  }
}

cloud "External Services" as Cloud #F5F3FF {
  component "Google Gemini API\n(LLM)" as Gemini
  component "AWS S3\n(Storage)" as S3
}

' Định tuyến mũi tên rành mạch (Thêm dấu cách trước chữ để không dính vào đường line)
Backend -down-> API : " Search, Recommend\n (Sync REST)"
Backend -down-> Worker : " Trigger Process PDF\n (Message/REST)"
Worker -up-> Backend : " HMAC Callback\n (Status)"

API -down-> Recommender : " Fetch suggestions"
API -down-> Embedding : " Encode search query"

Worker -down-> Embedding : " Encode chunks"
Worker -down-> LLMClient : " Generate metadata"

API -left-> DB : " Vector Search\n / Read logs"
Worker -left-> DB : " Write vectors\n & metadata"

Worker -right-> S3 : " Download PDF"
LLMClient -right-> Gemini : " API Calls\n (Throttle/Retry)"

' Ép vị trí vật lý để canvas tự bung rộng sang 2 bên
DB -[hidden]right- AIService
AIService -[hidden]right- Cloud
API -[hidden]right- Worker
Recommender -[hidden]right- Embedding
Embedding -[hidden]right- LLMClient

@enduml
